  "rep3_unmatched_alert_explanation": "In compare_scaling.py, alerts_before_count was computed via `sum(1 for _ in f)` which counted the CSV header line. At run end, it sliced `all_alerts[alerts_before_count:]` where `all_alerts = list(csv.DictReader(f))` (excluding the header). In rep3, alerts_before_count equaled the total data row count, returning an empty slice `[]`. The real alert ALT-1792925647643 was written to alerts_log.csv at 10:54:07.046Z and scaled rep3 at 10:54:08.83Z.",
